      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1074969925,
          "type": null,
          "body": "I haven't tested either of these, but the changes *should* work. The FreeBSD port includes Qt6Core5Compat and Qt6Multimedia, and presumably the Homebrew formula does as well.\n\n`macos-setup.sh` depends on offline installers, which aren't available for Qt >= 5.15. We might want to remove Qt there and point people to the online installer.",
